From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Internalize built-in event delivery

Reference: pret/pokeemerald @ 5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038

Reuse the existing Pokemon Center 2F Mystery Gift deliveryman as a permanent,
offline event distributor. The deliveryman is always visible, enables all four
event-island ship flags, gives missing event tickets when bag space permits,
and gives the built-in Surf Pichu Egg once.

The one-time Surf Pichu receipt state uses an otherwise unused save flag.
Legendary encounter completion flags are not changed.

diff --git a/include/constants/flags.h b/include/constants/flags.h
--- a/include/constants/flags.h
+++ b/include/constants/flags.h
@@
-#define FLAG_UNUSED_0x1E3                    0x1E3 // Unused Flag
+#define FLAG_RECEIVED_PERMANENT_SURF_PICHU   0x1E3 // EMERALD: offline external-event delivery

diff --git a/data/scripts/cable_club.inc b/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
--- a/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
+++ b/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
@@
 CableClub_EventScript_HideOrShowMysteryGiftMan::
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ShouldDistributeEonTicket
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, CableClub_EventScript_ShowMysteryGiftMan
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ValidateSavedWonderCard
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, CableClub_EventScript_HideMysteryGiftMan
-	goto CableClub_EventScript_ShowMysteryGiftMan
-	end
+	clearflag FLAG_HIDE_POKEMON_CENTER_2F_MYSTERY_GIFT_MAN
+	return
@@
 CableClub_EventScript_MysteryGiftMan::
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ShouldDistributeEonTicket
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, CableClub_EventScript_DistributeEonTicket
-	goto CableClub_EventScript_TryWonderCardScript
-	end
+	lock
+	faceplayer
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_SOUTHERN_ISLAND
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_BIRTH_ISLAND
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_NAVEL_ROCK
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_FARAWAY_ISLAND
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap
+	goto PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu
+	end
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_EON_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_EON_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_EON_TICKET
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_AURORA_TICKET
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_MYSTIC_TICKET
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap:
+	checkitem ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_OLD_SEA_MAP
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return:
+	return

diff --git a/data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc b/data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc
--- a/data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc
+++ b/data/scripts/gift_pichu.inc
@@
 sText_FullParty:
 	.string "Oh, your party appears to be full.\p"
 	.string "Please come see me after storing\n"
 	.string "a POKéMON on a PC.$"
+
+@ Permanent offline entry point used by the Pokemon Center 2F deliveryman.
+@ This deliberately uses its own receipt flag instead of
+@ FLAG_MYSTERY_GIFT_DONE, because that flag belongs to saved Wonder Cards.
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu::
+	goto_if_set FLAG_RECEIVED_PERMANENT_SURF_PICHU, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_AlreadyReceived
+	specialvar VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, CalculatePlayerPartyCount
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, PARTY_SIZE, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_FullParty
+	call PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_GiveEgg
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_PERMANENT_SURF_PICHU
+	msgbox sText_MysteryGiftEgg, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	playfanfare MUS_OBTAIN_ITEM
+	waitfanfare
+	release
+	end
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_FullParty:
+	msgbox sText_FullParty, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	release
+	end
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_AlreadyReceived:
+	msgbox gText_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift, MSGBOX_NPC
+	release
+	end
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_GiveEgg:
+	giveegg SPECIES_PICHU
+	setmodernfatefulencounter VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT
+	setmonmetlocation VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, METLOC_FATEFUL_ENCOUNTER
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, 1, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, 2, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot2
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, 3, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot3
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, 4, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot4
+	goto_if_eq VAR_GIFT_PICHU_SLOT, 5, PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot5
+	return
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot1:
+	setmonmove 1, 2, MOVE_SURF
+	return
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot2:
+	setmonmove 2, 2, MOVE_SURF
+	return
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot3:
+	setmonmove 3, 2, MOVE_SURF
+	return
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot4:
+	setmonmove 4, 2, MOVE_SURF
+	return
+
+PermanentEventScript_SurfPichu_Slot5:
+	setmonmove 5, 2, MOVE_SURF
+	return
